<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sẽkoo Au Gaa Ɓeenɛ Yɛnɛ Timoti Bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus Sẽkoo Au Gaa Beenɛ yɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoti Bi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Timoti u pɛ jakasa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a tipi Afisawa, u ɓiniu sipɛ su Yahudawa, ɓeye u ɓɛɛ shɔ Giriki. Timoti ɔ̃kɛ Bulus shɔdɔɔranɛ au shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ au vishonɛ Ɗanyaruubiini. Bulus sẽkoo au gaa beenɛ yɛnɛ Timoti ɗɔbii nwanya ayuu vi taati.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sẽkoom a ɗekɨn gaapɛ gɔ̃ shɔ yuusho aru vimatinɛ nyayeelinɛ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi tete. Vimatɛnɛm, shɔ ɓasi shɔ Yahudawayi a shɔ gbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a nyazɔ, sijo a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ gbete jazɛ Kotipim sipɛ kɔ̃linɛ, nɛ nyaba gbete shɔ kpaa naraanɛ pɛ aka viɓusinɛ zɛnɛkɔ sheeli, a nyaba gbete shɔ pɛliyɛ naa, yaanɛ vishaanɛ wɔɔyi, ama ɓa zɔ tɛnɛ ɓa. A ɓuzɨn sẽkoou wɔsɔ̃n nyakɔsinɛ ayuu shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi sãnɛ a Ɗalapa bassinɛ, piti a nɔgbete shɔ kasinɛ yupɛ̃ni shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛyi ɔ̃yɛni. Nyayisinɛ, shɔ geli Timoti nɔgbete yɛ ɔ̃ Yesɔ Kirisi jawɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn yɛ, a vipɛlinɛ gbeteu awuni a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi kn tottot.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi Au Ɓuzɨnyɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ ayuu shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ai Yupɛ̃niyini (1.3-3.16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ yɛnɛ Timoti bi au yuu vishonɛ (4.1-6.21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ ang naa Bulus, n pɛ Kirisi Yesɔ jashonɛ, pɛ Ɗalapa u shɔ-shɔraanɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ au pɔ̃sisɨn au bi lɔng-rɛ nɛn ɔ̃ jashonɛ.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />N beeri sẽkoom pɛ mɔkɔ Timoti, n javɔshɔ tɔ̃vɨn a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa Uɓeye a Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa u ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, raantanɛ, a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yushogɔ̃nɛ ayuu vimatinɛ nyayeelinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Nagbete n masɔɔbiiyɛ aɗagbete n si nyaba Makidoniya yɛnɛ n kasirɛ a ɔ̃ a Afisa, aruviya shɔwɔyi aɗɔgbeteyi mati shɔ ruunyayeeli a ɗɔnni, a pɔ̃yirɛ i yaatɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />A geliyi nɛi yaa sisɨn ãnɛtɔ a ruuɓere kɔ̃linɛyini au ɓɛuruyi nii raaki gɨnnɛni, vimiyi pɔ̃si shɔ naa ɓa n ti shɔ nyamasinɛ, shɔ pɛli ɓa vigbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ au shɛ atette sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Ruu sisɨn ãnɛm ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔu tadɔɔ zɔ ɔrinɛ wasa, au shɛ sisɨn tɔ̃vɨn, a lɛrinɛ tɔ̃vɨn a sisɨn ãnɛ gaanɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Zɔ gãsiyi risi vim kntitɛ, i nwalikɛ ruukɔ̃linɛ gbeteu vishonɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />I kasinɛyi ɔ̃ shɔmala nya-ãsinɛ Ɗalapa, ama i zɛ ruu gbete i shayɛ ɓa ko vigbeteyi nwanya ayuu fɛ̃ɛm kakani i ji zɛ ɓa.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />U zɛ tɛttɔ Musa nya-ãsinɛ pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng, shɔ kɛ pɛlivishonɛ nɛ awuni tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />U zɛ tɛttɔ, shɔ ji bee Musa nya-ãsinɛ ɓa aru shɔ tɔ̃vɨnyi yuu ɓa ama aru shɔgbeteyi ka nya-ãsinɛ a shɔ ruuvini kpete-kpetiyi yuu, shɔ gbeteyi Ɗalapa ɓa ai ɔ̃nɛni ɓa, a shɔ ruuviniyi, shɔ gbeteyi bassi Ɗalapa ɓayɛ ko a suru, a shɔ gbeteyi nyo ɓeyeyi ko ɓiniyini, a shɔ yuvɔnyonɛni. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />A shɔgbeteyi roo a shɔ soni ko a shɔ vɔshɔni, a vɔshɔ gbeteyi roo a vɔshɔni ko so gbeteyi roo a ɓɛzɔɔ soni, a shɔ gbeteyi ɓɔɔ shɔyɛ, a shɔ gbeteyi pɛli vi totti vigbete yɛɓa gbete a vimatinɛ tɔ̃vɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Vimatinɛm tɔ̃vɨn shɔ kpaa a ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete shɔ kosinnya nɛn shayɛ, ruu tɔ̃vɨn shapɛ a Ɗalapa gbete shɔ basiuyɛ a Ɗa tasiu susãri tɛttɔ biini.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɔ̃rinɛ aru Ɗalapa raantanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />N dɔ̃ri Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapatɛ, shɔ gbeteu ãng kaka n vishonɛyɛ. N dɔ̃riutɛ aru gbete gang re a lɔng-rɛ nɛn pɛlin vishonɛ, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />piti nɔgbete si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ n sha ruukɔ̃linɛ a Kirisi yuuni, n tasiu raatɔ, n dãutɔ. Ama Ɗalapa ntanraatɔ aruviya sin ji ãsisɨn ɓa, aruumkɔ sin ji zɛ vigbete n pɛliyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Uɓeyelapa nterin u tɔ̃vɨn shonɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm ayuu a ang sisɨn ãnɛ a ɔrinɛ gbeteu ɓɛɛ aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Shom pɛ ruu nizɛ a shɔ shayɛ nɛ, yɛ tɛttɔ nɔgbete shɔ tɛyɛ kpai shɔ ãsisɨn aɗɔn: Kirisi Yesɔ a kotipi aru u raa shɔruuviniyi. Atette shɔruuvini kpai nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete tɛɛ a ruuvinini, <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ama Ɗalapa ntanraatɔ aruviya n shɔ gbete n ruuvini tɛɛ kpai pɛlivishonɛ a nkɔni u tasi nɔgbete Kirisi Yesɔ sisɨnmɛɛnɛ au yisinya ɓa aɗɔn, u ɔ̃ kɛ vitasinɛ aru shɔ gbeteyi i yɛ ãsisɨn au bi, i kpaa suru gbete sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Mɛnɛ kpati au ɔ̃ dangdang, shɔ gbete yɛ vɔ ɓa, a shɔgbete shɔwɔ yɛ zɛu ɓa, ukɔ Ɗalapa gbete sheeli, tɛ banɛ a bassinɛni dangdang. Nankɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Majaa Timoti, n ãa nya-ãsinɛm ji nɔgbete janyagadiyi sha si knti aa yuuyɛ. Pɛli vishonɛ ji ruumiyikɔ naa viyaa bawaanɛ nɔgbete a waaba a wuni tɔ̃vɨn, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />a sã a sisɨn ãnɛ a vigbete a lɛrinɛni tɔ̃vɨn. Shɔwɔyi i ji wesho ɓa a vigbete i lɛriyɛ tɔ̃vɨn ni ɓa, i ji wesho ɓa a vigbeteyi lɛri ai ãsisɨn tɔ̃vɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Ai tete ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ Himeniyu a Alezanda, shɔgbete n ãyitɛ a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ naa u tasiraa; vim yɛ mati nɔɔ i yaa ruukɔ̃linɛ nwalinɛ a Ɗalapa yuuni.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Sisɨn Ãnɛyi Ɗa Bassinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Aru nankɔ n masɔɔbii ɔ gaa pɛ: ɔ gakitɔ, ɔ gaki Ɗa aru vigbete ɔ kasiyɛtɔ, ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a gakinɛni, ɔ dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ aru shɔzɛ piti kpai; <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />aru kpatiyi a shɔ gãsiyini gbeteyi sã ɗɔ pɛ̃nibani, nɔgbete u ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni, ɔ̃nɛ gbete shɔ bassi Ɗalapa yɛ a ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn ko-pi nyaba shɔpiya. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Shɔm pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, Ɗalapa shɔgbete raauyɛ nta yɛti purutɔ awuni, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />shɔgbeteu kasi kopiya u kpaa raanɛtɔyɛ, i kpaa tɔ̃vɨn zɛnɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Aruviya Ɗalapa gbete sheeli, shɔu shi atette Ɗalapa a shɔzɛni pɛ gbete, shɔm ukɔ Kirisi Yesɔ, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Shɔgbeteu ãu yuu aru u raa shɔzɛ piti kpai. A ɗaa au tɔ̃yɛ shɔwakɔ ɔ̃rɛ vitasinɛ gbete Ɗalapa kasi nɛ kopiya u kpaa raanɛtɔ, <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />A ruumkɔ shɔ shonrɛ nɛn ɔ̃ jashonɛ a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa shɔmala, n nwaruu sisɨn ãnɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng shanɛ . N yee ɓa nyaɓa; n geli shɔ pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng!<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />N kasirɛ kopiɗɔpiya shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ikɛ tolinyanɛ aru bassi Ɗa, n kasirɛ vɔshɔyi gaki Ɗa, vɔshɔ gbeteyi ãyuu tɛttɔ a Ɗalapa bi i ɗeeyi naa a lapa i ɗɔ Ɗa gakinɛ, ikɔyi lɛsi sisɨnɛ ikɔyi nyamasinɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />N kasi sɔ̃n, soroyi i bariki bi gbete ntotɔyɛ i tosi fãrãtɔ tɔ̃vɨn tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ; ikɔyi bariki vinɛ a sɔ̃yuu bang nɛyi baasipɛrɛ, ko fãrã mɛɛ, ko vikɔrɔ, ko fãrã au saa yuu bang, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Ama i shovishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn, gbete yɛ tasinɛi pɛ so gbeteyi ɓayi yuunɛ i pɛ shɔ Ɗalapa bassinɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Mɛnɛ soroyi i mati vi kali-kali a yuuãnɛ a vitɔ̃vɨng atette yuuroorinɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />N ji ãyi naa ɓa i mati shɔ virɛ ko i tasiyi kaka a vɔshɔyi yuuni ɓa; ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i ɔ̃ a nyanishok. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Aruviya Ɗalapa shɛshi pɛ Adamu ɗekɨn, kɛɗɔn a shɛshi Hawawu kɛkn. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Wɔsɔ̃n japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ji ɗaki ɓa Adamu ɓa; japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ɗaki pɛ soro aka Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Ama Ɗalapa yɛ raa soro a nyaba jaayi yeenɛ, naa kɛ yɛ ɗeknnɛ sisɨnmɛɛnɛ a sisɨn ãnɛni, a ɔrinɛ a ɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, a sisɨn roorinɛni.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yupɛ̃ni Wɛrɛ Ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Shɔm pɛ ruu nizɛ au shɔ shayɛ nɛː kopiya kɛ tɔnɛn kasi yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗa ɔ̃nɛ, pɛ tɔ̃vɨn u pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Yupɛ̃ni Wɛrɛ Ɗa ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u ruuvini u ɔ̃ ɓa; ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u so u ɔ̃ gbete, u ɔ̃ shɔu nta shɔ nyatɔyɛ, u ɔ̃ shɔ gbete sãu yuutɔyɛ, u ɔ̃ shɔgbete gɨn Musa nya-ãsinɛtɔ, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ au wɛrɛ u tɛ shɔzatiyi naatɔ; ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u zɛnɔɔ shɔvi matinɛtɔ; <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u ɔ̃ ɓa shɔ vikɔ̃linɛ ɓoonɛ ko shɔ bawaanɛ ɓa ama shɔu ɔ̃ shɔk a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔnɛ; ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u ɔ̃ ɓa shɔ saa kasinɛ ɓa; <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u zɛ nɔgbete yɛ gɨn au shɔwɛrɛyinitɔ tɔ̃vɨn, u pɔ̃rɛ u ɓɛɛ jaayi gɨn u nyatɔ i bassiutɔ kopinyaɓa shɔpiya. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Aruviya shɔ gbete ji zɛnɔɔ gɨnnɛ ɓa au shɔwɛrɛyini ɓa, yɛ zɛnɔɔ gɨnnɛ kɛpikovi a shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗani viya? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u sisɨn ãnɛ u lakitɔ, nɔgbete yuuɗenɛ yɛ pɔ̃u ɓa u to ɗɔ raaɓoonɛ u lɛsirɛ naa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ lɛsiyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />U ɔ̃ shɔ gbeteu bassinɛ aɗɔn a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa wɛrɛ Ɗa ni ɓa i ɗekɨn, nɔgbete shɔ yɛ ãuyusẽ ɓa, ukɔ nwesinɛ a tari gbete japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ɗayɛ.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔyi pɔ̃si shɔ Wɛrɛ Ɗayi naa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Shɔyi pɔ̃si shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗayi naa, ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng-yi pɛlinɛ, ɓa shɔ nyaziti ɓa; ɔriyitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i ɔ̃ ɓa shɔ gbeteyi ɓoo mii inabi bang ko shɔ gbeteyi kuli shɔ nɔɔ aru saa ɓa; <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i sã vitɔ̃vɨng gbete sisɨn ãnɛ ɓɛlirɛntɔ, i sisɨn u geliyitɔ nɛ i ji pɛli ruuvini ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Shɔ gaapɛ shɔ ntayi pɛtɔ a ɗekɨn, i ji ɔ̃ ɓa a ruuvinini ɓa, kɛɗɔn i sã vishonɛ kɛkn. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />I ɓesoyi ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng ɔkɔrɔ i vipɛlinɛ u ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn, ɓa shɔ shɔwoonɛ ɓa; ama i ɔ̃ shɔyi sãyi yuutɔ a shɔ gbeteyi kopiya ãsisɨntɔ ai biini a vi piti kpai. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u ɔ̃ a so gbete sheeli, u zɛnɔɔ ɓɛɛ jaayi sãnɛtɔ au shɔwɛrɛyini tɔ̃vɨntɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Shɔnaapɔ̃sinɛ gbete i pɛliyi vishonɛtɔ tɔ̃vɨn i nii ɔ̃ tɔ̃vɨn, i nwanyatɔ a kakani ayuu i sisɨn ãnɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ yuuni.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruɓusinɛ pɛ̃niba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Nagbete n beerɔɔ sẽkoom yɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa n pɔ̃ sisɨn n awɔ ɗɔbiitɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Ama n kɛ wariyunɛ, sẽkoom yɛ tasɔɔ nɔgbete u gɨn a wɛrɛ Ɗanitɔ, gbete ukɛ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ai gɨn Ɗalapa au suru aɗɔnyɛ, dɔjaa gbete sã tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Shɔwɔ yɛ tɔɓanɛn masinya nɔgbete u ruɓusinɛ pɛ̃niba ɔ̃yɛ au yuu Ɗalapani ɓa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Shɔ-shɔraanɛ shɛ a shɔzɛ shɛ̃ɛ̃bii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">shɔ tasiu nɛu pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a suru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ɗajashonɛyi zɛurɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Shɔ nwau ruubiitɔ a koo piti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">shɔ ãsisɨntɔ au bi a kotipini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">a shɔ tuurɛ yɛ kolapa.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔmala Nyayeenɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Ɗa suru sha tɛttɔ wasa-wasa nɛ a lee gadi shɔwɔyi yɛ yaa sisɨn ãnɛtɔ; i yɛ gɨn kɛ suru nyayeelinɛyi nya i gɨn vigbete rãmayi i mati shɔyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Vimatinɛ ɗɔmiyi pɛ shɔ shɔɗakinɛ nyayeelinɛyi ikɔyi sãti ruumrɛ, shɔ gbeteyi sisɨn vɔ tɛttɔ, naa shɔ too a saka shẽshẽ. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Shɔ ɗɔmiyi i mati shɔ vinɛ so tɛnɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, i geli shɔ sɔ̃nnɛ shɔkɔ shaa zɔng vishaanɛ wɔɔyinɛ. Ama Ɗalapa shɛshi vishaanɛ miyi nɛ shɔu shaatɔ, shɔgbeteyi ã sisɨntɛ i zɛ tɔ̃vɨntɛ i tɛrɛ i tasi dɔ̃rinɛ i shaarɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Kopiviya gbete Ɗalapa shɛshiyɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn; shɔkɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ viwɔɔnɛ, ama ko-iviya shɔ tɛrɛ shɔu dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa au yuuni, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />aruviya Ɗanyaruubii a Ɗa gakinɛ ukɔ pɔ̃rɛ a ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ Ɗalapa tɛrɛ.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirisi Yesɔ Jawɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />A kɛ mati shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi vimiyinɛ, a yɛ ɔ̃ Kirisi Yesɔ jawɛrɛ tɔ̃vɨn, vim tasi akɛ mataa yuu vitɔ̃vɨng miyi nɛ ruu sisɨn ãnɛ a suru wɔsɔ̃n vimatinɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbetaa gɨnyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Ama a bɛ̃ɛ̃ vigbete ji shɛ ɓa a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii ɓa matinɛtɔ, a ruuɓere kɔ̃linɛyi, gbeteyi pɔ̃ shɔrɛ shɔu bassi Ɗalapa ɓa, ama a yɛ ɗekɨn a vigbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ naa pɛliyɛ matinɛni. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Bi kasinɛ a jazɛbii u jaa vishonɛ aɗɔn ama bi kasinɛ a suru ko-pi nyaba shɔpiya tɛɛ ko-ivayatɛ, aruviya pɔ̃si shɔ naatɔ ko aa ɔ̃nɛ a suruni ko knti gbete a vɔtɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Nya shanɛm pɛ nizɛ, yɛtɛ nɔgbete kopiya u tɛrɛ u ã sisɨn aɗɔn. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Aruumkɔ u mabiirɛ u pɛlishonɛ fɛ̃ɛm, aruviya u pɔ̃ sisɨn a Ɗalapa gbete u suru aɗɔn bi, shɔ gbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ-shɔraanɛ kpai, badijo shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨntɛyɛ.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />A kɔsiyinyamtɔ a vimatiyi vimiyitɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Mɔkaa yaa shɔwɔnɛ u tɔnɛ a vimatinɛ ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa aru nɛ apɛ jujaa, ama aa nyanwanɛ a ɔ̃kɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi vitasinɛ, aa ɔ̃nɛni, aa shɔ ɔrinɛ, aa sisɨn ãnɛ, wɔsɔ̃n a suru sɔɔnɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔni. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Setɛ n atɛ, a shɔ ɗekɨn a ãyuutɔ a mabiitɔ a laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii ɓalinɛni, a nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubiitɔ a mati shɔ vitɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Mɔkaa yaa vishonɛ suru pɛlinɛ nɛ gbete aa binɛ, shɔ gbete shɔ ãyɛ aɗagbete janyagadi nwanya a shɔpɛ̃ni dɔlaayi pɔ̃saanaa yuuyɛni. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />A pɛli jo vimiyikɔ a ãyuu aɗɔn, nɔgbete shɔ yɛ zɛa a vishonɛ ɗekɨn yɛnɛ kpai. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />A kɔyuutɔ fɛ̃ɛm aa vimatinɛni. A yɛ ɗekɨn a vimiyi pɛlinɛni, aruviya a kɛ pɛlinɛ, a yɛ raa a yuutɔ a shɔgbeteyi ntaa vigbete a shayɛni kpai.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Vishonɛ Gbeteu pɛli Shɔwɔyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Mɔkɔ lasi shɔpɛ̃ni nɛ, ama a gakiutɔ naa u pɛ mɛye. A tuu jaa vɔyi naa mɛzɔ̃yi, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />a tuu su pɛ̃niyi naa miniyi, a tuu jasu nyarãyi naa mɛnayi, a sɔɔ sisɨntɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />A bassi su vɔyitɔ shɔgbeteyi shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Ama naa suvɔ u jaayi kɛ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn ko jawuruyi, vigbete i gaa matinɛ ai wɛrɛ pɛ i nyaba vishonɛ Ɗa gɨnnɛ, kɛ a nyabamkɔ i sɔɔri ɓeye a ɓini a ɓɛuru a ɓɛtarani naapɔ̃sinɛ gbeteyi kpaayɛtɛ, aruviya vimkɔ pɔ̃ Ɗalapa u nta tɔ̃vɨnrɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Suvɔ shɔgbeteu a yɔbmyɛ, shɔgbeteu shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ ɓa, pɔ̃ sisɨn a Ɗalapa bi, u yɛ ɗekɨn a Ɗa gakinɛ zɨmba a niti ni u gakiu rɛ u pɔ̃siunaa. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ama suvɔ gbete ãyuu aru u nta tɔ̃vɨn a jazɛbii, ko u a suruni vɔ ɓɛɛ tɛttɔ gboti, <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />A kɔsiyinyantɔ, nɔgbete shɔ kpaayi ɓa a ruuvinini ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ama shɔgbeteyi ji pɔ̃siu shɔbiiyi naa ɓa, badijo u shɔwɛrɛyi, i masinyatɛ ã sisɨn ãnɛni, i vipɛlinɛ tɛɛ shɔ gbeteyi ji ã sisɨn ɓatɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Suvɔ gbete ji tɛɛ saa laa taati ɓa, mɔkaa gau niinɛ atette suvɔyini. nyakonɛ wɔsɔ̃n, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u ɔ̃ suvɔ au tɛ vɔshɔ ɓa gbete. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />u ɔ̃ su gbete shɔ zɛu tɛttɔ pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng a shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛniː su gbete mati ɓɛɛ jaayi vitɛ tɔ̃vɨnyɛ, su gbete tɛ shɔ zatiyi naatɔ au wɛrɛniyɛ, au rooriyuu pɛli Kirisa wɔyi vishonɛtɔ, atette yuukɔnɛ pɔ̃si shɔ naatɔ, au ãyuu a tɔ̃vɨn shonɛyɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Ama mɔkaa tosi nyarã suvɔyi niinɛ a suvɔyi nii ni; aruviya i bi kɛ kasinɛ naa i tɛ vɔshɔ, i risi Kirisi kɨntitɔ, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />aru vɔshɔ gbeteyi tɛ sɔ̃nyɛ, arumkɔ Ɗalapa yɛ tasiyi raatɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Ɓa ukɔ sheeli ɓa i wariyuu i ɔ̃li waati i ɗɔgbeteyi gɨn wɛrɛ-wɛrɛyɛ; ama ɓa ɔ̃nɛ wese gbeteyi ɔ̃yɛkɔ sheeli ɓa, i nwanya shɔ woonɛ a ɓiishanɛni i to vishonɛ gbete ɓayi ɓɛɛ ɓa, au ji tɔ̃ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Aruukɔ ang kasinɛ suvɔ jasunyarãyi tɛ vɔshɔtɔ, i kpaa jaayi i kɔi wɛrɛtɔ, nɔgbete u nɔpɔ̃yi kpaa nyaba gbeteyi nwanwa kɔ̃linɛ ɓa au yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Aruviya suvɔ wɔyi i yaa nyabatɛ gboti i ɗɔ japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ gɨnnɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Ama naa su Kirisa wɔyi suvɔ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ai wɛrɛni ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u pɔ̃siunaatɔ, shɔkɔ pɔ̃nɛ nɛ shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa i pɛlirɛ, nɔgbete shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa i kpaa nyaba gbeteyi pɔ̃si suvɔyi naa kɛkn a shɔ gbeteyi shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ ɓani.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Shɔpɛ̃ni gbeteyi pɛlivishonɛ yupɛ̃ni tɔ̃vɨn pɛ tɔ̃vɨn shɔu shoritɔ tɔ̃vɨn, badijo shɔgbeteyi nwa Ɗanyaruubii fɛ̃ɛm yɛ a shɔ vimatinɛni. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Aruviya laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ ku gunapu nyaɓa naakɛ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔ vishonɛ pɛlinɛ a jaa, shɔ vishonɛ pɛlinɛ tɔ̃ɔ̃tɔ u kpaa u viɗɔnwanɛtɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Mɔkaa pɔ̃naanɛ a nyayeelinɛ gbete shɔ pɛli shɔpɛ̃ni yɛni, setɛ shɔzɛ ziti ko taati i shitɛ aa kɨntini. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />A shari shɔ gbeteyi pɛli ruuvini gãgã a shɔnɔɔ, aru zɔ gãsiyi i yɛ ntasetitɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />A Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a Kirisi Yesɔ, a Ɗajashonɛlayi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, n ãsaanya a gɨn nyakɔsinɛmtɔ mɔkaa tasi yuu vɔsinɛ nɛ ko tasinɛ nɛn kasi ba shɔwɔ tɛɛ shɔ gãsiyitɔ aa vigbete a pɛliyɛni. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Mɔkaa nisinɛ a lɔɔ shɔwɔ a pɔ̃siunaa a yuu nɛu ɔ̃ yupɛ̃ni setaa zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ ãsisɨntɛ a Uɓeyelapa biini. A ɓasiyuu ɓa a shɔwɔyi ruuvinini ɓa ama a sã a yuu a ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Mɔkaa ɓoonɛ miikɔ sheeli ama ɓoo mii inabi fɛ̃ɛ aru yɛti kɔnɛ aa vɔrɔbii, u pɔ̃saanaa viu pũrɛ aa yɛti.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Shɔwɔyi ruuvini a shɔ nɔɔ a ɓili weze, shɔ ɓɛɛ ruuyeenɛ ai yuu shɔ yɛ zɛyi ruuvinitɔ; ama zɔ gãsiyi ruuvini shɔ zɛ a knti. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Ji nankɔ vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn a ɓili weze shɔ zɛtɔ, ko shɔgbete ɓa ɓili ɓa shɔ ɓusi dɔɔɓa.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Ko-piya kpai ai fooyi yɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i bassi i shɔwɛrɛtɔ ko-pi nyaba shɔpiya, nɔgbete shɔwɔ yɛ nwanya kɔ̃linɛ ɓa Ɗalapa nii ni ɓa au vimatinɛni. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Fooyi gbete i shɔwɛrɛyi a ɗɔnni i sɔ̃n shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ɓatɛ tasiyi bassinɛ fɛ̃ɛ ɓa aru nɛi ɓɛɛzɔ̃yi ɓa nɔgbeteyi si pɛli nam ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i bassi i shɔwɛrɛyitɔ fɛ̃ɛm, aruviya shɔ gbeteyi shayinaa vishonɛ i pɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi, sɔ̃n shɔgbete shɔ ɔriyɛ, vim pɛ vigbete shɔ yɛ a masi shɔbiiyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Shɔ gbete mati shɔ vi totti au ji yɛ zɔɓa a vimatinɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi matiyɛni ɓa <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />shɔmi u pɛ shɔ yubassinɛ, au zɛnɛ nɛn zɛvitɛ piti kpai ama ji zɛvi ko fɛ̃ɛ ɓa. shɔ ɗɔmiyi i vi ɓɛɛ jo nyamasinɛ ayuu ruuyi, vimkɔ n ti, gɨnkaanɛrɛ, bawaanɛ, dãnɛ, zɔ nii lɛsinɛyi. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />A nyamasinɛ kopiɗaviya a shɔgbeteyi sisɨn shavi tɔ̃vɨn tɔkɨn ɓa, ai sisɨn nɛ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ pɛ nyaba saa kãnɛ.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ama pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng au ɗɔbiini u pɛli vigbete Ɗalapa ɔriyɛ, naa vigbete ãuyɛ teesiutɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Aruviya u ji to kotipi ɓa viwɔɔni ɓa, naa u kɛ vɔnɛ u tuu viwɔɔ ɓa naani ɓa! <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Aru nankɔ u kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a vishaanɛ a fãrãyini, teesi tɛttɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Ama shɔ gbeteyi kasi vinaa kpaanɛ i nwesirɛ a shɔ sisɨn ntanɛ naa, a tari gbete shɔ kɔ̃linɛyi ɗayɛ vikasinɛ tottot, vikasinɛyikɔ ikɔyi yɛ gɔ̃irɛ anɛ nyaba lɛsinɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Aruviya shɔ gbeteyi kasi saa bang i pɛli vi kɔ̃linɛ kopishɔpiyatɔ i kpaa saa rɛ. Shɔ gãsiyi i yaa vimatinɛtɛ ayuu Kirisi ni aru i kasi saa bang, i pɔ̃yi yuutɛ a raaɓoonɛ a nyaba tottot.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Ãsi Timoti Nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Ama mɔkɔ Timoti, a pɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ, a yaa viwatɔ kpai a mabii a kã tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, sisɨn ãnɛ, ɔrinɛ, sisɨnmɛɛnɛ, a yuurorinɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />A ɔ̃ shɔ bawaanɛ aru sisɨn ãnɛ, naa soja tɔ̃vɨn a nyasɨnyɛ, a sisɨn ukɔ vɔnɛ, a ã sisɨn a Ɗalapa bi a gɨunyatɔ aruviya Ɗalapa ɓaa a nyajo au yuukɔ, gbete a shitɛttɔ tɔ̃vɨn a sisɨn ãnɛni a shɔ ɗekɨn au yuuni. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />N ãsaanya a Ɗalapa a Kirisi Yesɔ ɗekɨn, shɔgbete ã vi suruyɛ piti kpai, shɔ gbete u ɗɔ zɛnɛ, Yesɔ sha vi tɔ̃vɨntɔ aɗagbete Buntus Bilatu hɨliu ruuyɛ <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />a gɨn nyaãsinɛmtɔ naa a pɛli a sisɨn gbete yɛnɛ lee gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi yɛ shɛyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Yɛ shɛpɛ alee gbete Ɗalapa lɔɔyɛ, Ɗalapa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ kpati gbete shɔ bɛliuyɛ sheeli, kpatiyi i kpati a Uɓeyelapayi Uɓeyelapa. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />U kɔ sheeli vɔɓa, ɔ̃ a ɗɔsẽsẽ gbete shɔwɔ zɛnɔ anɛ ɓa ɗɔnni ɓa. Shɔwɔɔ ji zɛu ɓa shãani ɓa; shɔwɔɔ yɛ zɛunɔ zɛnɛ sɔ̃n ɓa, au kabiikɔ shɔ yɛ bassi Ɗalaparɛ, kopiɗaviya yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓa dangdang! Nankɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />A ãsi shɔ gbeteyi vinaa aɗɔn a kotipim ɔ̃nɛni nya ikɔyi basi yunɛ, ko ikɔyi pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛi saa yɛ shoshiyi vishonɛtɔ piti kpai, ama i pɔ̃ sisɨn a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, shɔ gbete ãu vitɔ fɛ̃ɛm aru gbete ntauyɛti purutɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />A kɔsinya nɛi pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨn, i vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ u shatɔ, i ɔ̃ shɔvi ãnɛ fɛ̃ɛm, i ɗɔgbeteyi pɔ̃si shɔwɔɔyi naa. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />A nyabangkɔ i yɛ pɔ̃siyi yuu vinaatɔ au yɛ ɔ̃kɛ gɨngɨn ɔ̃nɛ a kolapa, Kɛɗɔn Ɗa yɛ shaariyi kɛkɨn a ɔ̃nɛ ganɛni.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoti mabii a pɛli vigbete Ɗalapa kɔsaanya naa pɛliyɛtɔ. A yaa ruukɔ̃linɛ nwalinɛtɔ a nyamasinɛyi gbete shɔwɔɔyi i ɓaanɛ &lt;&lt;Vizɛnɛni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Aruviya shɔwɔɔyi tɛ vizɛnɛ nyayeelinɛm tɛttɔ, aru nankɔ i nii nyaba sisɨn ãnɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni kpai.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>